 me excited so you want to  have a big goal and a big dream and a  big why for your business as well  something that excites you and makes you  want to get up and go to work number two  is have a little why and the little why  are the little things that you do every  day to help remind yourself of the  impact that you're having when I find  sometimes is that big goal can be too  big it can be too  this animus ominous ominous it can be  too big and and then it makes it seem  like that's not possible like I can  never do that right there sometimes we  wake up when you're bold I can totally  do that  and some days you wake up like oh I  can't do that there's no way I can do  that at Who am I to do that and so  that's where the little Y's come in the  little Y's are the little reminders from  people who you help this show that hey  you're having an impact and you're  making a difference so for me to share  an example my goal is to help a billion  entrepreneurs a billion are you guys  grow your business that's my big why the  little why are the YouTube comments the  Twitter comments the little feedbacks  that I get from you emails saying hey  your video your message helped change my  life that's why I incorporate social  media into my morning routine because it  helps me start my day when I get my  youtube comment feed full of awesome  comments from you guys seeing how much  of an impact I've had on you and your  business that makes me excited right  that makes me want to keep going and  want to do more and gets me motivated to  get up and do something just a little  bit harder today now I'm lucky because I  have an audience now and I've built it  up and had some traction of momentum  success but I was doing this when I was  getting started as well  my first sessions in helping people were  making presentations and doing live  seminars and I would have them fill out  feedback forms at the end to say what  they thought about that they liked had  not liked it what could I improve on and  there were so many positive comments  that came from those sessions that what  I would do is take their comments and  put it into a PowerPoint file and I  would watch the PowerPoint file every  morning because I could have a great  session one night right Thursday night  have a great session and really touch  people's lives and feel like man I'm  doing some great work I'm really having  an impact be on top of the world and  then I go to sleep and I wake up on  Friday mornings and the energy is gone  it's like well what happened and you're  starting from scratch I find for me I'm  starting from scratch every single day  so I need to have this routine built in  to help me stay motivated and be  successful so looking at that PowerPoint  file of all the feedback and comments  that I got from people who came to my  events that really  we stay motivated so you can do it too  by looking at people who you've helped  and maybe an email that came in just  save the best of the best stuff and  surround yourself with that every  morning to know that yes that you have  this big goal that you want to  accomplish but on a small scale you're  helping people to write like the work  you're doing now is important already  it's already having a meaningful impact  on some people's lives and that gets you  motivated to keep going and number three  is environment and routine I'm a huge  believer that you are a product of your  environment you'll probably make as much  money as your parents make you probably  make as much money as your friends make  and you know they'll have the same  impact on the world that they made and  the only way to break free of that is to  change your routine and to change your  environment and so I try to surround  myself with greatness if I want to  achieve greatness if you want to achieve  greatness you have to surround yourself  with greatness that was the whole point  of the morning series that I launched  I've recently launched a morning series  where every morning at 7:00 a.m. it's an  inspirational video from that has a  message from a famous entrepreneur and  I'm adding to it and I felt personally  me like I didn't still you know you may  look at me and say hey Evans got it all  figured out and I'm so grateful and so  happy with what I've accomplished so far  but I want to do more right like I want  to have a bigger impact and I felt like  I want something to help people think  bigger to help me think bigger I want  something I can go to every day to help  stretch me to make me think like I can  accomplish more because I live in a  bubble you live in a bubble and you grow  by expanding that comfort zone and so  there wasn't anything out there that I  loved right there's a motivational stuff  where there's like a guy yelling at you  to say you're gonna go do this you let  her go change the world you know it  works for some people it doesn't work  for me right I get more motivated by  inspirational things by stories I seen  people go out and try to do something  that's beyond themselves that makes me  want to do something beyond myself and  so that's why I started the morning  series and so far it's worked that well  you know love to know you know your  feedback on it but changing your  environment changing your routine  surrounding yourself with greatness in  all aspects the people in your life the  TV shows the YouTube videos you watch  the music you listen  - I have a belief playlist that I  listened to every morning that I  recently made public so you could check  it out if you want to hear what I listen  to but put on songs that make you move  that make you want to dance and make you  want to get up and do something right  everything in your life has to make you  become the best version of yourself if  you want to go out and do something  great in this world so that's all I got  your big why your little why and then  your environment and your routine  believe for those who are watching I'd  love to know how you stay motivated if  you have any tricks or tricks  trick tips or tricks that you want to  share put it in the comments below I  love to see it and follow along and if  you guys like this video and you want to  see more don't forget to subscribe to  the newsletter and the channel thank you  so much for watching I'll see you soon  doo doo doo doo doo doo doo - Doo

